,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":651.218559794,"data":"Okay, so I have this problem here with three complex numbers a, b, and c. They satisfy these three equations:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":651.218569861,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":651.21857334,"data":"First, (a + 1)(b + 1)(c + 1) = 1,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":651.218575788,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":651.218579083,"data":"Second, (a + 2)(b + 2)(c + 2) = 2,\n"}
